  "text": "The hiring vetting system that builds a dependable, high-output creative bench for growing agencies. Creative bottlenecks occur when founders spend all week reviewing mediocre design submissions instead of closing retainers. Without automated screening filters, leadership wastes twenty hours monthly reviewing unqualified applicants and messy test files. Route applicant test submissions through Make to an Airtable scoring board that calculates composite grades automatically. You protect executive time and onboard top talent effortlessly.",
